        "zh": "DSpark 草稿模型不可用",
        "en": "DSpark draft model is unavailable"
      }
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "zh": "使用 RadixArk Qwen3.8 DSpark 草稿 checkpoint，block size 7，开启 overlap 调度",
